            "review_title": "Review at Hà Nội Ơi - Vietnamese kitchen",
            "review_text": "Nga N\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nRecommend Vietnamese restaurant in Hanoi\nJul 2026 • Friends\nHà Nội Ơi is a wonderful place to experience authentic Vietnamese cuisine. The atmosphere is warm, cozy, and beautifully decorated, creating the perfect setting for a relaxed meal. The food was fresh, full of flavor, and prepared with great attention to detail. Every dish tasted authentic and delicious.\n The prices are very reasonable for the quality of the food and the overall dining experience. I would definitely recommend Hà Nội Ơi to anyone visiting Hanoi and will happily come back again!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nBeef Ribs Stew and Seafood is great\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 6, 2026",
